        "overview": "DOMI wins this battle because he is more consistent across all three rounds. His first and third are clearly stronger, and his second is competitive even though TAPPED24 gets the bigger reaction there.\n\nHis first round is a full character assassination. He attacks TAPPED24’s appearance, hygiene, drugs, homelessness, teeth, smell, clothing and name. The “Tapped / tap / bath” section is simple but effective, and the repeated “crap twenty-four / whack twenty-four / trash twenty-four” flips make the round easy to score.\n\nHis second round is solid and direct. He keeps the same pressure, using TAPPED24’s name, smell, lack of brains, bad appearance, Santa’s elf imagery, tablet/iPad flips and education/GCSE material. TAPPED24 probably edges the round on reaction, but DOMI does not lose control.\n\nHis third is the deciding round. DOMI stays cleaner and more complete, with the birth certificate apology line, teeth/LGBTQ setup, Zeus, Ghana, English pronunciation and flag angle. It is not his funniest round, but it is controlled and enough to close the battle.\n\nDOMI’s biggest strength is structure. He comes with completed rounds and a clear attack plan every time.",
