      "verdict": "Archive Judgement: F-DON",
      "summary": "Archive result: F-DON wins.\n\nArchive score: F-DON 1-0 K.I.M.E.\n\nRound split:\nRound 1: F-DON\n\nReason: K.I.M.E’s round is very strong and packed with writing, but F-DON edges the one-rounder with clearer structure, stronger delivery and a more effective final section. The Charmander/Charizard opener, shortness scheme and bar-fight/bartender section give F-DON the cleaner overall performance.\n\nPerformance Grades\nF-DON: A-\nK.I.M.E: B+\n\nFinal Note: This is a close, high-output one-rounder. K.I.M.E brings the heavier technical writing, but F-DON sounds more controlled and lands the cleaner closing argument."
